ADDENDA (ORGANIZATION OF THE MINISTRY OF FINANCE AND ECONOMY) <Presidential Decree No. 35947, 2025.12.30>

Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 2, 2026: Provided, That among Presidential Decrees amended under Article 6 of these Addenda, portions amending Presidential Decrees promulgated before the enforcement of this Decree but not yet in force shall each enter into force on the enforcement date of the relevant Presidential Decree.
Articles 2 through 5 Omitted.
Article 6 (Amendments to other statutes) ① through <271> Omitted.
<272> Part of the Enforcement Decree of the Korea Ocean Business Corporation Act shall be amended as follows:
In Article 8 (1), "Minister of Economy and Finance" shall be replaced with "Minister of Finance and Economy".
<273> through <313> Omitted.
